WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.368
<v Human Services Supervisor>Thanks for walking that case with me. I want to

00:00:03.368 --> 00:00:06.737
<v Human Services Supervisor>be honest. When you raised the concern the third time,

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:09.768
<v Human Services Supervisor>my first instinct was to explain the policy again.

00:00:10.118 --> 00:00:13.309
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>I could tell. And I understand it. But I was

00:00:13.309 --> 00:00:16.500
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>not confused about the policy. I was thinking about one

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.734
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>person whose plan changes almost every month.

00:00:19.084 --> 00:00:22.444
<v Human Services Supervisor>That is what I missed. You were describing a real

00:00:22.444 --> 00:00:25.804
<v Human Services Supervisor>case, and I was treating it as an attitude problem.

00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:28.773
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>When we walked it through, most of the new process

00:00:28.773 --> 00:00:31.392
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>held up better than I expected. I will say that

00:00:31.392 --> 00:00:32.178
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>to the team.

00:00:32.528 --> 00:00:35.408
<v Human Services Supervisor>That will carry more weight from you than from me.

00:00:35.408 --> 00:00:38.288
<v Human Services Supervisor>And the second change in one month really had no

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:41.168
<v Human Services Supervisor>owner. I have sent that to the person responsible for

00:00:41.168 --> 00:00:44.048
<v Human Services Supervisor>the process. I expect an answer by the end of

00:00:44.048 --> 00:00:44.624
<v Human Services Supervisor>next week.

00:00:44.974 --> 00:00:48.006
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>What helps me is knowing when. Before, I kept hearing

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:50.734
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>that things would be worked out, with no date.

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:54.748
<v Human Services Supervisor>That fits what research on change in public agencies has

00:00:54.748 --> 00:00:58.413
<v Human Services Supervisor>found. In one study of youth care workers, getting more

00:00:58.413 --> 00:01:02.077
<v Human Services Supervisor>information was not linked to commitment. Taking part in how

00:01:02.077 --> 00:01:05.742
<v Human Services Supervisor>the change worked was. So was feeling able to handle

00:01:05.742 --> 00:01:06.108
<v Human Services Supervisor>it.

00:01:06.458 --> 00:01:09.338
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>That matches how I feel. I do not need more

00:01:09.338 --> 00:01:11.930
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>emails. I need to know my concerns go somewhere.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.562
<v Human Services Supervisor>There is also a lot of talk about the new

00:01:15.562 --> 00:01:18.844
<v Human Services Supervisor>director changing things. I am telling staff and counties the

00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:22.126
<v Human Services Supervisor>same thing. The start date and the steps are confirmed.

00:01:22.126 --> 00:01:25.407
<v Human Services Supervisor>The training schedule is still open, and I will update

00:01:25.407 --> 00:01:26.392
<v Human Services Supervisor>everyone on Friday.

00:01:26.742 --> 00:01:29.807
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>Honestly, saying what you do not know makes me trust

00:01:29.807 --> 00:01:30.726
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>the rest more.

00:01:31.076 --> 00:01:33.771
<v Human Services Supervisor>Can I ask you to help with one more thing?

00:01:33.771 --> 00:01:36.467
<v Human Services Supervisor>Would you bring two more tough cases to next week's

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:39.162
<v Human Services Supervisor>meeting? I would rather find the gaps now than have

00:01:39.162 --> 00:01:41.588
<v Human Services Supervisor>a person waiting for services find them in March.

00:01:41.938 --> 00:01:44.638
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>I can do that. I will bring the hardest ones

00:01:44.638 --> 00:01:45.178
<v Disability Services Program Consultant>I have.
